# ============================================================
#   DvE - icons of the Russian Republic focus tree (RUR_national.txt).
#   One sprite per focus, named after the focus. The .dds files in
#   gfx/interface/goals/RUR/ are copies of RUS/UKR/POL/ITA icons
#   and of vanilla generic goal icons:
#   replace a file to change its art. legacy_lazy_load = no loads
#   the texture at startup (without it the icons can show as "?"
#   on this Mac). Shine sprites: RUR_icone_focus_shine.gfx
# ============================================================

